1
00:00:06,170 --> 00:00:10,310
If I one day become a mere bandit,

2
00:00:10,310 --> 00:00:11,940
I ask that you strike me down.

3
00:00:11,940 --> 00:00:14,600
I ask that you do the same,
if I begin walking a similar path.

4
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:15,810
A sickness, in her blood?

5
00:00:15,810 --> 00:00:18,850
There is currently no cure for such illness.

6
00:00:18,850 --> 00:00:20,690
We shall organize the Zhisi Squadron.

7
00:00:20,690 --> 00:00:23,350
I am Wang Lun, the leader of Liangshan Marsh.

8
00:00:23,350 --> 00:00:26,150
Does our imperial court now
warrant such fighting?

9
00:00:26,150 --> 00:00:28,850
Defect, and you will find your path!

10
00:00:28,850 --> 00:00:31,740
You have proven your incompetence.

11
00:00:31,740 --> 00:00:34,730
Prove yourself useful in the Qingzhou army.

12
00:00:34,730 --> 00:00:37,190
Is he a dog of the Imperial Guard?

13
00:00:37,190 --> 00:00:39,650
To Lin Chong's victory. Cheers!

14
00:00:39,650 --> 00:00:42,140
Cheers!

15
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:47,770
Lin Chong!

16
00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:52,800
[Liangshan Marsh]

17
00:00:56,650 --> 00:00:59,340
Is Lin Chong...

18
00:00:59,340 --> 00:01:01,950
He was poisoned.

19
00:01:01,950 --> 00:01:04,360
Drinks were served using jade cups.

20
00:01:04,360 --> 00:01:08,060
If they drank from silver,
the mark of poison would remain.

21
00:01:08,060 --> 00:01:10,090
Our opponent is no amateur.

22
00:01:10,090 --> 00:01:12,000
Who would do such a thing?

23
00:01:15,790 --> 00:01:18,620
No, I am innocent, An Dao Quan!

24
00:01:19,850 --> 00:01:23,770
I am a doctor.
The culprit is of no interest to me.

25
00:01:23,770 --> 00:01:26,210
I only care about saving my patients.

26
00:01:26,900 --> 00:01:30,760
Leave us. We cannot entertain visitors.

27
00:01:30,760 --> 00:01:32,840
Right.

28
00:01:32,840 --> 00:01:34,630
I apologize for intruding.

29
00:01:38,160 --> 00:01:41,460
Watch yourself. He saw you enter.

30
00:02:02,650 --> 00:02:04,000
A measure against poisoning?

31
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:08,940
Yes. Prepare any antidotes ahead of time.

32
00:02:08,940 --> 00:02:10,520
The more, the better.

33
00:02:10,520 --> 00:02:12,540
Will that be possible, Xue Yong?

34
00:02:13,270 --> 00:02:15,520
Yes, however...

35
00:02:15,520 --> 00:02:16,980
Speak.

36
00:02:16,980 --> 00:02:20,100
Some poisons kill instantly,

37
00:02:20,100 --> 00:02:21,830
leaving no time for antidotes.

38
00:02:21,830 --> 00:02:26,480
Which is why I have brought along
the best apothecary in the land.

39
00:02:26,480 --> 00:02:28,200
What measures can be taken?

40
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:34,060
There is one way to circumvent such poisons.

41
00:02:34,060 --> 00:02:35,650
How?

42
00:02:35,650 --> 00:02:38,480
You must take the antidote ahead of time,

43
00:02:38,480 --> 00:02:42,295
to buy time until proper treatment.

44
00:02:42,295 --> 00:02:44,900
Then take it I shall.

45
00:02:44,900 --> 00:02:47,980
Yet why only worry about poison?

46
00:02:47,980 --> 00:02:50,360
There are many other ways to kill a man.

47
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:54,750
Only poison could kill a man like myself.

48
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:58,460
For I am strong.

49
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:05,540
Show me that strength of yours, Lin Chong.

50
00:03:41,640 --> 00:03:43,720
What a wound.
[Episode 5]

51
00:03:43,720 --> 00:03:46,150
Poor fellow.

52
00:03:46,150 --> 00:03:51,150
He was mauled by a tiger.

53
00:03:51,150 --> 00:03:55,150
Is there truly a man-eating tiger
around these parts?

54
00:03:55,150 --> 00:03:57,000
Care to linger, and find out?

55
00:04:03,020 --> 00:04:05,850
Really, what a shame for him.

56
00:04:05,850 --> 00:04:09,120
Another young one, gone and killed.

57
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:20,500
Surely he could have died elsewhere.

58
00:04:42,370 --> 00:04:46,480
I have slain the tiger.

59
00:04:46,480 --> 00:04:50,840
Pardon? You slayed the tiger?

60
00:04:50,840 --> 00:04:53,080
I beat it to death.

61
00:04:54,420 --> 00:04:56,830
D-Do not lie, lad.

62
00:04:56,830 --> 00:05:00,710
A mere human could never best a mighty tiger!

63
00:05:34,500 --> 00:05:36,850
If only...

64
00:05:38,320 --> 00:05:40,100
I were lying.

65
00:05:46,170 --> 00:05:50,690
- Sir, it's terrible!
- Wh-What now?

66
00:05:50,690 --> 00:05:55,735
A massive tiger lies dead
in the clearing ahead!

67
00:05:55,735 --> 00:05:58,695
- The tiger is dead?
- Impossible.

68
00:06:11,965 --> 00:06:13,960
Hello?

69
00:06:13,960 --> 00:06:16,315
Is there anyone home?

70
00:06:16,315 --> 00:06:17,955
Po Xi?

71
00:06:20,455 --> 00:06:22,060
Sir Song Jiang.

72
00:06:22,060 --> 00:06:25,360
Is it true,
Chen Li's condition has taken a turn?

73
00:06:25,360 --> 00:06:28,460
Yes. She is currently resting
after taking some medicine.

74
00:06:28,460 --> 00:06:30,090
I see.

75
00:06:30,892 --> 00:06:32,510
Will she...

76
00:06:33,635 --> 00:06:39,830
We can only help to ease her pain.

77
00:06:39,830 --> 00:06:44,095
Zhu Gui has not left her side in days.

78
00:06:44,095 --> 00:06:45,875
Is that so.

79
00:06:46,765 --> 00:06:51,600
I bring flowers,
to lift the patient's spirits.

80
00:06:51,600 --> 00:06:53,060
Thank you, sir.

81
00:06:54,620 --> 00:06:56,090
Xue Yong.

82
00:07:01,285 --> 00:07:03,820
I hear Lin Chong is recovering well?

83
00:07:03,820 --> 00:07:08,390
Yes. It is a blessing he drank an antidote
ahead of time.

84
00:07:10,136 --> 00:07:14,466
I cannot continue to send him
on these dangerous missions...

85
00:07:17,650 --> 00:07:23,380
Do not be glum, Song Jiang.
Else you will collapse next.

86
00:07:24,665 --> 00:07:28,580
My struggle is nothing, compared to you all.

87
00:07:28,580 --> 00:07:30,620
Xue Yong.

88
00:07:30,620 --> 00:07:33,710
Would you pass this to Lin Chong?

89
00:07:33,710 --> 00:07:36,275
It details various reports
from across the land.

90
00:07:36,275 --> 00:07:38,280
Of course.

91
00:07:38,280 --> 00:07:41,040
Shall I pass a message to him as well?

92
00:07:41,905 --> 00:07:43,750
A message, you say...

93
00:07:43,750 --> 00:07:45,920
Chen Li!

94
00:07:51,820 --> 00:07:53,790
The medicine, please.

95
00:07:54,530 --> 00:07:56,830
Medicine will help her no further.

96
00:08:02,285 --> 00:08:04,790
Chen Li!

97
00:08:04,790 --> 00:08:07,090
Chen Li...

98
00:08:18,335 --> 00:08:20,610
What is it?

99
00:08:20,610 --> 00:08:22,450
Try again, please.

100
00:08:24,890 --> 00:08:26,670
Chen Li?

101
00:08:27,730 --> 00:08:31,010
What did you say, Chen Li?

102
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:35,840
Chen Li!

103
00:08:43,730 --> 00:08:45,710
"Thank you".

104
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:49,450
I believe that is what she mouthed to you.

105
00:09:00,250 --> 00:09:02,270
Sir Song Jiang.

106
00:09:03,520 --> 00:09:06,010
Thank you.

107
00:09:12,340 --> 00:09:17,400
Thank you for giving my wife and I
the time to speak again.

108
00:09:18,290 --> 00:09:21,250
You allowed us to make up for lost time.

109
00:09:21,900 --> 00:09:28,220
She and I... We spoke all that we could.

110
00:09:40,385 --> 00:09:43,070
Dr. An Dao Quan.

111
00:09:43,070 --> 00:09:45,485
Dr. Xue Yong.

112
00:09:45,485 --> 00:09:47,845
Thank you.

113
00:09:50,410 --> 00:09:54,020
Yan Po Xi, thank you.

114
00:09:55,590 --> 00:09:59,590
Ruan Xiao Wu, thank you.

115
00:10:10,410 --> 00:10:12,120
Chen Li...

116
00:10:13,290 --> 00:10:15,420
Chen Li...

117
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:20,730
- Chen Li...
- Let us give them space.

118
00:10:35,480 --> 00:10:39,590
Please ask Lin Chong one question.

119
00:10:54,685 --> 00:10:57,190
Lin Chong.

120
00:10:57,190 --> 00:10:59,385
I see you are well.

121
00:10:59,385 --> 00:11:01,415
What a blessing to us all.

122
00:11:02,610 --> 00:11:05,740
Here. I have brought you a gift.

123
00:11:07,690 --> 00:11:10,470
Thank you kindly, sir.

124
00:11:11,620 --> 00:11:16,590
We have executed your assailant.

125
00:11:17,330 --> 00:11:19,470
I apologize for the trouble he caused.

126
00:11:22,933 --> 00:11:25,750
I am relieved to hear he is gone.

127
00:11:25,750 --> 00:11:28,345
Sir, my patient has yet to fully recover.

128
00:11:28,345 --> 00:11:32,795
Right. I apologize for intruding.

129
00:12:06,935 --> 00:12:09,210
He is sitting over there.

130
00:12:09,210 --> 00:12:12,830
But the poor lad won't speak a word.

131
00:12:14,710 --> 00:12:17,980
Could you allow us some time alone?

132
00:12:18,760 --> 00:12:20,790
Of course.

133
00:12:35,756 --> 00:12:42,441
The hero who slayed a tiger
with his bare hands, is it?

134
00:12:42,441 --> 00:12:47,330
I cannot believe I'm greeted
with a familiar face.

135
00:12:47,330 --> 00:12:49,519
Wu Song.

136
00:12:49,519 --> 00:12:51,580
I should have expected as such.
[Wu Song, Tiger-slaying Hero (Ally)]

137
00:12:51,580 --> 00:12:54,430
I am glad to see you well.
[Wu Song, Tiger-slaying Hero (Ally)]

138
00:12:59,350 --> 00:13:01,690
You look gaunt, my friend.

139
00:13:02,500 --> 00:13:04,700
Were you gravely injured?

140
00:13:11,500 --> 00:13:13,830
Speak to me, Wu Song.

141
00:13:27,443 --> 00:13:29,183
What happened to you?

142
00:13:44,040 --> 00:13:50,390
The tiger-slaying hero,
reduced to a mere husk.

143
00:13:51,830 --> 00:13:55,310
Was your heart wounded in the fight?

144
00:13:55,310 --> 00:13:58,020
Reminds me of those fists of yours.

145
00:13:59,770 --> 00:14:03,850
You require a doctor.

146
00:14:05,130 --> 00:14:10,670
Only one man in this land
could heal your soul.

147
00:14:14,499 --> 00:14:18,669
I am certain he will save you.

148
00:14:23,460 --> 00:14:27,660
Yang Zhi is displeased
with the current state of this nation.

149
00:14:27,660 --> 00:14:33,010
He is a descendant
of a Song Dynasty hero, after all.

150
00:14:33,925 --> 00:14:38,380
Can we appeal to his frustration,
and bring him to our side?

151
00:14:38,380 --> 00:14:42,460
Unfortunately, his strong beliefs
are also his biggest obstacle.

152
00:14:42,460 --> 00:14:44,650
As a descendant of a hero,

153
00:14:44,650 --> 00:14:48,040
he feels he cannot betray the nation.

154
00:14:48,040 --> 00:14:55,090
Bloodlines, for better or for worse,
tend to shackle us.

155
00:14:56,135 --> 00:14:58,500
Gongsun Sheng is correct.

156
00:14:58,500 --> 00:15:00,700
To which I raise a plan.

157
00:15:00,700 --> 00:15:05,321
We will have the nation
cast Yang Zhi aside.

158
00:15:05,321 --> 00:15:07,091
How so?

159
00:15:07,910 --> 00:15:14,180
Yang Zhi has been ordered
to deliver Cai Jing his bribes.

160
00:15:15,170 --> 00:15:17,140
We will have our men steal his cargo.

161
00:15:20,045 --> 00:15:23,950
Meaning Yang Zhi will fail his mission.

162
00:15:23,950 --> 00:15:26,970
Our opponent is a cautious warrior.

163
00:15:27,660 --> 00:15:30,020
This will be no easy task.

164
00:15:30,790 --> 00:15:34,050
We must plan our next moves carefully.

165
00:15:35,940 --> 00:15:37,670
Gongsun Sheng.
[Gongsun Sheng, Zhisi Squadron]

166
00:15:50,655 --> 00:15:53,900
Are you off to visit Lin Chong, again?

167
00:15:53,900 --> 00:15:55,120
Yes.

168
00:15:55,120 --> 00:15:58,370
Did my first warning not suffice?

169
00:15:58,370 --> 00:16:00,330
Du Qian, has greed taken your soul as well?

170
00:16:00,330 --> 00:16:02,480
It would never.

171
00:16:02,480 --> 00:16:05,610
But you are only drawing
Wang Lun's suspicion.

172
00:16:05,610 --> 00:16:08,460
And you fear his suspect gaze?

173
00:16:08,460 --> 00:16:11,310
I fear the discord it could cause.

174
00:16:11,310 --> 00:16:15,160
Wang Lun is now a beast
who knows no trust.

175
00:16:15,160 --> 00:16:18,380
Then what does that make us,

176
00:16:18,380 --> 00:16:20,460
the protectors of said beast?

177
00:16:33,325 --> 00:16:37,210
I crave meat. Even sheep will do.

178
00:16:37,210 --> 00:16:39,140
Quiet. Eat your meal.

179
00:16:40,985 --> 00:16:43,020
Excuse me, gentlemen.

180
00:16:43,020 --> 00:16:47,380
I bring food,
to celebrate your appetite's recovery.

181
00:16:53,335 --> 00:16:54,700
Here, eat.

182
00:16:54,700 --> 00:16:59,257
You do not need to prove the food is safe.

183
00:16:59,257 --> 00:17:03,927
I never suspected you, Song Wan.

184
00:17:10,322 --> 00:17:14,410
Wang Lun has an army of 300 men
under his direct command.

185
00:17:14,410 --> 00:17:18,050
He calls this army of his,
his Imperial Guard.

186
00:17:19,965 --> 00:17:21,360
Imperial Guard?

187
00:17:21,360 --> 00:17:24,520
Yes.

188
00:17:24,520 --> 00:17:32,370
He has come to believe
he is an emperor of sorts.

189
00:17:32,370 --> 00:17:35,260
I question where his old ambitions have gone.

190
00:17:36,750 --> 00:17:40,510
Yet we only turned
a blind eye to this change.

191
00:17:41,505 --> 00:17:48,060
I am his second-in-command.
Song Wan, his third.

192
00:17:48,060 --> 00:17:50,345
We have seen the men
who spoke against Wang Lun.

193
00:17:50,345 --> 00:17:54,415
The ones who were jailed,
and ultimately assassinated.

194
00:17:55,960 --> 00:17:58,630
Why are you sharing your stories with me?

195
00:18:00,675 --> 00:18:05,580
Your arrival here shook my core.

196
00:18:05,580 --> 00:18:09,000
You survived the Imperial Guard's prison.

197
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:12,515
You then escaped another soon after.

198
00:18:12,515 --> 00:18:17,955
And now, you have infiltrated
this perilous fortress.

199
00:18:18,690 --> 00:18:21,350
You fear no cell,
nor assassin which may come your way.

200
00:18:23,250 --> 00:18:30,790
Yet my admiration for you
may prove to be my demise.

201
00:18:32,625 --> 00:18:35,940
For I am a weak man.

202
00:18:35,940 --> 00:18:38,140
You are not weak.

203
00:18:39,235 --> 00:18:44,290
When I witnessed your poisoning,
I came to despise myself.

204
00:18:44,290 --> 00:18:48,710
I had only learned to cower
in Wang Lun's presence.

205
00:18:50,740 --> 00:18:52,824
That is why...

206
00:18:52,824 --> 00:18:56,815
Taking Wang Lun's neck
is a rather simple task.

207
00:18:57,605 --> 00:19:01,890
Yet if we kill him now,
it will only cause conflict.

208
00:19:01,890 --> 00:19:09,020
That is why we first require a new leader.

209
00:19:11,535 --> 00:19:16,480
Please wait for his arrival a moment longer.

210
00:19:16,480 --> 00:19:19,090
You will not take the mantle yourself?

211
00:19:32,030 --> 00:19:34,470
[Enforcing the Way in Heaven's Name]

212
00:19:43,140 --> 00:19:49,270
When we are ready, I will wear a black obi.

213
00:19:52,376 --> 00:19:54,856
Until then, await my signal.

214
00:19:56,605 --> 00:19:59,820
[Beijing]

215
00:19:59,820 --> 00:20:02,770
The descendant of a hero, escorting bribes?

216
00:20:02,770 --> 00:20:05,070
How utterly humiliating.

217
00:20:05,070 --> 00:20:09,140
I will have you both join Yang Zhi's troop.

218
00:20:09,140 --> 00:20:11,200
What a pity, indeed.
[Kong Ming, Qingzhou Army (Ally)]

219
00:20:11,200 --> 00:20:16,290
First demoted,
and now transporting "cargo" for Cai Jing.

220
00:20:16,290 --> 00:20:20,085
He remains unaware of what he carries.
[Kong Liang, Qingzhou Army (Ally)]

221
00:20:20,085 --> 00:20:21,815
Bai Sheng.

222
00:20:26,415 --> 00:20:28,770
Good evening, sirs.

223
00:20:28,770 --> 00:20:30,795
- Who is this?
- A thief.

224
00:20:30,795 --> 00:20:34,235
A man fit for the job.

225
00:20:36,175 --> 00:20:38,860
You will find his skills useful.

226
00:20:38,860 --> 00:20:44,515
So we steal the loot,
without hurting Yang Zhi, eh?

227
00:20:44,515 --> 00:20:48,035
Certainly you must be dreaming.

228
00:20:49,005 --> 00:20:51,709
Bai Sheng, was it?

229
00:20:51,709 --> 00:20:59,870
You dare disrespect the trust
Chao Gai and Wu Yong have in you?

230
00:20:59,870 --> 00:21:02,540
They don't trust me.

231
00:21:02,540 --> 00:21:04,410
Chao Gai has chosen this man for the job.

232
00:21:04,410 --> 00:21:05,690
We share a common goal.

233
00:21:05,690 --> 00:21:08,790
What goals?

234
00:21:08,790 --> 00:21:11,000
I couldn't care less about 'em.

235
00:21:11,000 --> 00:21:13,815
Run your mouth all you wish.

236
00:21:13,815 --> 00:21:15,800
The graveyard is full of boasting men

237
00:21:15,800 --> 00:21:19,280
who all died in vain like yourself.

238
00:21:20,554 --> 00:21:23,090
You think I fear death?

239
00:21:25,785 --> 00:21:27,920
Look at this scar.

240
00:21:27,920 --> 00:21:30,700
What about it?

241
00:21:30,700 --> 00:21:34,110
I had my rotting stomach
taken out in the snow.

242
00:21:34,110 --> 00:21:36,215
I died once already when it happened.

243
00:21:36,215 --> 00:21:38,945
In the snow?

244
00:21:40,425 --> 00:21:44,560
You must be the man who escaped
with An Dao Quan and Lin Chong.

245
00:21:44,560 --> 00:21:47,520
If not for them, I'd be a dead man.

246
00:21:47,520 --> 00:21:52,480
I want to join my saviors in that fortress.

247
00:21:52,480 --> 00:21:57,770
Which means I need to gain trust, first.

248
00:21:57,770 --> 00:22:00,730
Every man here has their own motives.

249
00:22:00,730 --> 00:22:04,005
Yet we each aim for the same end point.

250
00:22:04,005 --> 00:22:06,405
Is that not enough for you all?

251
00:22:08,705 --> 00:22:11,950
I apologize for offending you, Bai Sheng.

252
00:22:11,950 --> 00:22:14,620
Let us execute this operation, together.

253
00:22:15,400 --> 00:22:18,500
It will feel great to steal a man's bribe.

254
00:22:19,240 --> 00:22:21,080
I count on your expertise to aid us.

255
00:22:23,765 --> 00:22:25,120
When will the operation commence?

256
00:22:25,120 --> 00:22:27,030
In seven days' time.

257
00:22:27,030 --> 00:22:31,770
Wu Yong has expertly plotted a plan for us.

258
00:22:31,770 --> 00:22:33,380
Yan Qing.

259
00:22:44,842 --> 00:22:48,820
[Mount Ziniu]

260
00:22:52,580 --> 00:22:54,920
We will arrive shortly.

261
00:22:57,120 --> 00:22:58,960
You holding up alright?

262
00:22:59,785 --> 00:23:01,510
Wu Song.

263
00:23:01,510 --> 00:23:06,340
Does it not feel nice
to simply walk an isolated mountain path?

264
00:23:08,310 --> 00:23:11,050
I wonder, is that a shrike?

265
00:23:13,350 --> 00:23:17,840
Do not worry. You will learn to speak again.

266
00:23:19,745 --> 00:23:21,840
Look there.

267
00:23:21,840 --> 00:23:23,840
We have just about arrived.

268
00:23:30,000 --> 00:23:32,260
What a calming place this is.

269
00:23:33,205 --> 00:23:38,300
Indeed. I find the solitude quite relaxing.

270
00:23:38,300 --> 00:23:40,695
[Wang Jin, Former Martial Arts Instructor]

271
00:23:40,695 --> 00:23:42,605
Lu Zhi Shen.

272
00:23:43,480 --> 00:23:47,950
My martial arts is incapable
of reforming this world.

273
00:23:48,625 --> 00:23:51,100
Then I shall not pester any further.

274
00:23:51,100 --> 00:23:55,727
But if I may ask, why not?

275
00:23:55,727 --> 00:24:00,527
My teachings require much self-reflecting.

276
00:24:01,205 --> 00:24:04,560
Then while it may not reform the world,

277
00:24:04,560 --> 00:24:08,040
perhaps it may help reform a lost soul.

278
00:24:08,040 --> 00:24:11,780
How about it?

279
00:24:11,780 --> 00:24:14,110
Your letter was concise enough.

280
00:24:14,110 --> 00:24:16,020
I know what you ask of me.

281
00:24:17,555 --> 00:24:19,650
Is he the one you call Wu Song?

282
00:24:19,650 --> 00:24:22,370
Yes. He is practically a dead man walking.

283
00:24:23,855 --> 00:24:25,770
I understand.

284
00:24:25,770 --> 00:24:28,000
I shall watch over him here.

285
00:24:33,570 --> 00:24:36,010
Wu Song.

286
00:24:50,310 --> 00:24:55,540
Ground yourself by touching this soil.

287
00:24:57,270 --> 00:24:59,950
Your wounds will heal in due time.

288
00:25:01,270 --> 00:25:05,000
That is what you must believe.

289
00:25:05,950 --> 00:25:08,450
Believe, and wake up to a new day.

290
00:25:10,665 --> 00:25:13,270
That is all I ask of you.

291
00:25:13,270 --> 00:25:16,000
And you will repeat this cycle,
for as long as you need to.

292
00:25:19,875 --> 00:25:22,070
Rest easy.

293
00:25:22,070 --> 00:25:26,040
Life here will change you.

294
00:25:28,980 --> 00:25:31,000
Lu Zhi Shen.

295
00:25:32,074 --> 00:25:34,780
Where will your journey take you next?

296
00:25:34,780 --> 00:25:38,025
I plan to travel down south.

297
00:25:38,025 --> 00:25:39,995
I see.

298
00:25:41,085 --> 00:25:45,940
May I entrust you with a letter for Shi Jin?

299
00:25:45,940 --> 00:25:47,620
A letter?

300
00:25:49,088 --> 00:25:52,650
I worry he will have lost his way,

301
00:25:52,650 --> 00:25:58,295
and addressed my concerns in writing.

302
00:25:58,295 --> 00:26:00,065
Wait a moment, I will bring it here.

303
00:26:04,400 --> 00:26:09,000
Please, quench yourself
after your long journey.

304
00:26:14,107 --> 00:26:16,007
Lu Zhi Shen.

305
00:26:16,765 --> 00:26:21,490
Why are his fists so battered?

306
00:26:21,490 --> 00:26:26,360
He trained by pummeling tree and rock.

307
00:26:26,360 --> 00:26:31,995
I believe he felt pain
was a necessity to him.

308
00:26:31,995 --> 00:26:36,565
My, what a poor soul.

309
00:26:44,340 --> 00:26:47,950
Your fists are filled with sadness.

310
00:27:07,400 --> 00:27:08,980
This is...

311
00:27:10,280 --> 00:27:13,620
Those are winter daphnes.
We use them for antidotes.

312
00:27:16,313 --> 00:27:18,600
I see.

313
00:27:18,600 --> 00:27:20,430
Do you like winter daphnes?

314
00:27:35,197 --> 00:27:37,230
No.

315
00:27:37,230 --> 00:27:39,390
I do not.

316
00:27:41,585 --> 00:27:44,900
I hear we established
our own Zhisi Squadron.

317
00:27:44,900 --> 00:27:47,150
A covert squad will prove useful.

318
00:27:47,150 --> 00:27:50,050
How are things on your end?

319
00:27:50,745 --> 00:27:53,730
Wang Lun has rotted to the core.

320
00:27:53,730 --> 00:28:01,400
Yet we cannot underestimate
the power he has built within this fortress.

321
00:28:01,400 --> 00:28:05,755
Though many secretly despise Wang Lun,

322
00:28:05,755 --> 00:28:09,605
they can only cower at his glare.

323
00:28:10,555 --> 00:28:13,940
All who rebel against Wang Lun are killed,

324
00:28:13,940 --> 00:28:18,690
or imprisoned in the dark,
until they've gone mad.

325
00:28:18,690 --> 00:28:20,784
Rebel!

326
00:28:20,784 --> 00:28:25,534
It is difficult to garner support
from those who obey out of fear.

327
00:28:26,230 --> 00:28:28,000
I see.

328
00:28:30,075 --> 00:28:33,520
Your porridge.

329
00:28:33,520 --> 00:28:38,750
I must continue to gather allies
within these walls.

330
00:28:38,750 --> 00:28:43,650
Please tell Chao Gai
we are not yet ready for his attack.

331
00:28:43,650 --> 00:28:44,925
Of course.

332
00:28:44,925 --> 00:28:47,455
- Thank you.
- No problem.

333
00:28:51,835 --> 00:28:56,850
Before I forget, Song Jiang
had a rather strange question for you.

334
00:28:56,850 --> 00:28:58,390
What is it?

335
00:28:58,390 --> 00:29:00,520
Well...

336
00:29:00,520 --> 00:29:04,160
He simply asked about the name of your wife.

337
00:29:04,160 --> 00:29:06,045
My wife?

338
00:29:06,045 --> 00:29:07,435
Yes.

339
00:29:20,020 --> 00:29:22,040
My wife's name...

340
00:29:25,310 --> 00:29:27,040
I no longer remember it.

341
00:29:28,530 --> 00:29:30,720
That is my answer to him.

342
00:29:32,940 --> 00:29:35,830
Are you certain?

343
00:29:45,666 --> 00:29:49,416
This porridge is delicious.

344
00:29:50,265 --> 00:29:53,240
It is filled with spring greens,

345
00:29:53,240 --> 00:29:55,950
all of which have medicinal effects.

346
00:29:55,950 --> 00:30:01,255
I envy your natural skill
to concoct medicines.

347
00:30:01,255 --> 00:30:07,195
I only excel at killing my fellow men.

348
00:30:18,680 --> 00:30:23,260
[Chancellor's Cargo]

349
00:30:37,462 --> 00:30:44,040
Why use such a blade for the Imperial Guard,
and not for our people?

350
00:30:44,040 --> 00:30:48,080
[Yang Zhi, Qingzhou Army Officer]

351
00:31:05,205 --> 00:31:07,810
Yang Zhi.

352
00:31:07,810 --> 00:31:12,660
I am honored to have you at my abode.

353
00:31:14,915 --> 00:31:17,950
May I offer a drink?

354
00:31:17,950 --> 00:31:19,410
No, I will refrain.

355
00:31:20,135 --> 00:31:22,160
I am currently on duty.

356
00:31:22,160 --> 00:31:24,194
I apologize for declining such generosity.

357
00:31:24,194 --> 00:31:29,144
Yang Zhi, have you forgotten what day it is?

358
00:31:30,100 --> 00:31:31,500
Pardon?

359
00:31:32,470 --> 00:31:36,910
It is the day the hero, Yang Ye, passed.

360
00:31:47,875 --> 00:31:49,496
What is this?

361
00:31:49,496 --> 00:31:54,966
This is the very cup Yang Ye once used.

362
00:31:55,730 --> 00:31:57,750
So you say...

363
00:31:59,276 --> 00:32:05,816
What went through his mind,
as he drank his liquor? I do wonder.

364
00:32:08,780 --> 00:32:14,630
If I have begun to question my orders,

365
00:32:15,445 --> 00:32:19,890
what do you reckon I should do, Lu Jun Yi?

366
00:32:19,890 --> 00:32:23,350
Soldiers are not meant to question orders.

367
00:32:23,350 --> 00:32:26,370
And yet, if I still do?

368
00:32:26,370 --> 00:32:30,215
Then you must quit,
and be a soldier no longer.

369
00:32:30,215 --> 00:32:33,065
Else you'd quit being a human altogether.

370
00:32:40,285 --> 00:32:45,020
Tonight, let us raise a toast
to your ancestors,

371
00:32:45,020 --> 00:32:48,160
as a sort of offering to them.

372
00:32:48,810 --> 00:32:50,410
Yan Qing.

373
00:33:19,165 --> 00:33:20,770
Yang Zhi.

374
00:33:20,770 --> 00:33:24,650
A commander must not drink in solitude.

375
00:33:24,650 --> 00:33:29,620
Why not extend this celebration
to your men as well?

376
00:33:29,620 --> 00:33:31,040
Indeed.

377
00:33:32,500 --> 00:33:34,910
I have a message for our men.

378
00:33:36,125 --> 00:33:40,870
Tell them they may enjoy a drink tonight.

379
00:33:40,870 --> 00:33:42,370
Yes, sir.

380
00:33:47,770 --> 00:33:50,720
The commander is letting us drink!

381
00:33:53,455 --> 00:33:55,670
My, my.

382
00:33:55,670 --> 00:33:58,155
It seems one drink will not suffice.

383
00:33:58,155 --> 00:33:59,535
That, it won't.

384
00:34:02,140 --> 00:34:03,580
Please, go on.

385
00:34:30,245 --> 00:34:32,690
Mount Huangni...

386
00:34:32,690 --> 00:34:36,450
Yes, it will surely be a difficult climb

387
00:34:36,450 --> 00:34:39,770
after the liquor Lu Jun Yi has offered them.

388
00:34:39,770 --> 00:34:44,250
Liquor will only fuel
the frustration in these soldiers.

389
00:34:44,250 --> 00:34:47,690
This is where Kong Ming
and Kong Liang will shine.

390
00:34:47,690 --> 00:34:49,960
Treat the cargo with care!
[Mount Huangni]

391
00:34:49,960 --> 00:34:52,560
- Your response?
- Yes, sir!

392
00:34:52,560 --> 00:34:55,295
<i>We will take our mountain climb slow.</i>

393
00:34:55,295 --> 00:35:00,615
Else we'd lack the strength
to whisk the cargo away.

394
00:35:01,345 --> 00:35:04,690
Wu Yong, finish the explanation.

395
00:35:04,690 --> 00:35:08,692
By the time they reach the peak,

396
00:35:08,692 --> 00:35:11,904
Yang Zhi's hungover men will be exhausted.

397
00:35:13,105 --> 00:35:15,650
March!

398
00:35:15,650 --> 00:35:18,320
These are grueling slopes, sir.

399
00:35:18,320 --> 00:35:22,160
Our men are clearly faltering.

400
00:35:22,160 --> 00:35:24,940
They had too much to drink last night.

401
00:35:24,940 --> 00:35:26,450
Push on!

402
00:35:26,450 --> 00:35:31,100
This is where Kong Liang
will suggest taking a break.

403
00:35:31,100 --> 00:35:33,870
Sir, we must let our men rest.

404
00:35:33,870 --> 00:35:35,350
Right.

405
00:35:36,110 --> 00:35:38,580
We'll be taking a break here.

406
00:35:43,960 --> 00:35:47,200
- Hurry.
- Just a bit further.

407
00:35:48,060 --> 00:35:49,430
Sirs.

408
00:35:51,325 --> 00:35:55,185
There, the Ruan brothers, Bai Sheng,
and Gongsun Sheng

409
00:35:55,185 --> 00:35:58,020
will act as water peddlers.

410
00:35:58,020 --> 00:36:02,210
Like an oasis found in a desert.

411
00:36:03,495 --> 00:36:09,060
Will this be enough to slow Yang Zhi's march?

412
00:36:09,060 --> 00:36:14,140
That is where our other trick comes in play.

413
00:36:14,140 --> 00:36:18,511
There has been a bandit attack up ahead.

414
00:36:18,511 --> 00:36:20,201
Understood.

415
00:36:25,495 --> 00:36:26,920
What now?

416
00:36:26,920 --> 00:36:28,410
Bandits, sir.

417
00:36:28,410 --> 00:36:32,940
It seems hundreds
are assailing a village up ahead.

418
00:36:32,940 --> 00:36:36,150
These peddlers are stuck here
in fear of the crossfire.

419
00:36:36,150 --> 00:36:38,650
The local clerks are of course no help.

420
00:36:38,650 --> 00:36:40,130
Can't they do more?

421
00:36:40,130 --> 00:36:42,330
Quiet!

422
00:36:42,330 --> 00:36:45,870
Sir, please forgive my insolence.

423
00:36:45,870 --> 00:36:47,730
Ignore us peddlers.

424
00:36:47,730 --> 00:36:53,690
I realize you have far more
important business to attend to.

425
00:36:53,690 --> 00:36:56,425
Yang Zhi, with his strong sense of justice,

426
00:36:56,425 --> 00:37:02,665
will have his hero's heart
set ablaze by such a statement.

427
00:37:04,641 --> 00:37:09,160
Kong Ming and Kong Liang
will then give him one last push.

428
00:37:09,160 --> 00:37:13,370
We are currently escorting cargo
to Chancellor Cai Jing.

429
00:37:13,370 --> 00:37:17,560
We have no orders to vanquish any bandits.

430
00:37:17,560 --> 00:37:21,810
Orders are orders. What a shame.

431
00:37:21,810 --> 00:37:24,110
No. Our citizens are in need.

432
00:37:24,110 --> 00:37:26,240
We must lend them a hand.

433
00:37:26,240 --> 00:37:28,925
Bandits are but a disorderly gathering.

434
00:37:28,925 --> 00:37:31,455
It will not take long to do away with them.

435
00:37:32,495 --> 00:37:34,140
Kong Liang.

436
00:37:34,140 --> 00:37:36,980
Take half our men as a vanguard.

437
00:37:36,980 --> 00:37:39,718
We must chase away these terrorizing bandits.

438
00:37:39,718 --> 00:37:42,028
If possible, bring me the ringleader as well.

439
00:37:44,520 --> 00:37:48,310
Come this far,
and our victory is guaranteed.

440
00:37:52,415 --> 00:37:56,440
Yang Zhi, I must make one request.

441
00:37:56,440 --> 00:38:00,200
Our men will require sustenance.

442
00:38:05,560 --> 00:38:09,470
You there. I'd like my men to have water.

443
00:38:16,965 --> 00:38:19,030
Will this suffice?

444
00:38:19,030 --> 00:38:21,070
S-Such generosity!

445
00:38:21,070 --> 00:38:23,855
Please, drink everything we have.

446
00:38:23,855 --> 00:38:27,495
- Go on.
- Get your water.

447
00:38:33,055 --> 00:38:35,110
Here, please.

448
00:38:35,110 --> 00:38:38,060
- Thank you so much.
- Hurry.

449
00:38:38,060 --> 00:38:39,590
Here.

450
00:38:39,590 --> 00:38:42,710
Please, take as much as you need.

451
00:38:42,710 --> 00:38:45,020
Are we replenished?

452
00:38:45,020 --> 00:38:49,010
Then we ride on.

453
00:38:49,010 --> 00:38:50,320
Drink, drink.

454
00:38:50,320 --> 00:38:51,520
The village is up ahead.

455
00:38:51,520 --> 00:38:52,990
That way.

456
00:38:52,990 --> 00:38:56,086
Here, drink. Drink.

457
00:38:56,086 --> 00:38:58,006
Any more?

458
00:38:58,710 --> 00:39:01,060
For you, sir.

459
00:39:17,510 --> 00:39:19,650
A paralysis poison.

460
00:39:25,645 --> 00:39:28,330
We hold no ill will towards you, Yang Zhi.

461
00:39:28,330 --> 00:39:32,895
Cai Jing is simply not worthy of this cargo.

462
00:39:32,895 --> 00:39:34,255
What?

463
00:39:35,135 --> 00:39:37,280
You will not die.

464
00:39:37,280 --> 00:39:40,220
We were ordered to keep you alive.

465
00:39:40,986 --> 00:39:42,714
Yang Zhi,

466
00:39:42,714 --> 00:39:47,620
you were transporting bribes
meant for Chancellor Cai Jing.

467
00:39:47,620 --> 00:39:49,620
They have deceived the descendant of a hero

468
00:39:49,620 --> 00:39:54,315
to unknowingly dirty his own hands.

469
00:39:54,315 --> 00:39:59,475
Do you still defend
this utterly corrupt nation?

470
00:40:18,950 --> 00:40:24,600
We await you at Liangshan Marsh.

471
00:40:45,195 --> 00:40:48,870
Chancellor Cai Jing was angered.

472
00:40:48,870 --> 00:40:51,490
That is quite rare for the chancellor.

473
00:40:51,490 --> 00:40:53,290
It cannot be helped.

474
00:40:53,290 --> 00:40:59,520
A meager troupe of bandits
robbed the illustrious Qingzhou army.

475
00:40:59,520 --> 00:41:06,510
Yet they committed theft
without harming any of Yang Zhi's men.

476
00:41:06,510 --> 00:41:09,650
We must be against quite the tactician.

477
00:41:09,650 --> 00:41:12,850
They are far too crafty for mere bandits.

478
00:41:12,850 --> 00:41:16,530
I am especially suspicious of one individual.

479
00:41:16,530 --> 00:41:21,195
A man named Chao Gai, of Yuncheng.

480
00:41:21,195 --> 00:41:24,495
Let me hear your reasoning.

481
00:41:24,495 --> 00:41:27,510
Lin Chong's escort was ambushed by bandits.

482
00:41:27,510 --> 00:41:30,290
Two soldiers came out of the attack alive,

483
00:41:30,290 --> 00:41:33,070
and successfully escorted him to prison.

484
00:41:33,070 --> 00:41:36,825
We were ambushed by bandits.

485
00:41:36,825 --> 00:41:39,395
We do not know their intentions.

486
00:41:40,910 --> 00:41:42,850
Bring him here.

487
00:41:48,420 --> 00:41:53,440
I figured it would not hurt
to torture the escort.

488
00:41:55,225 --> 00:41:58,500
Only two nails were lost,

489
00:41:58,500 --> 00:42:02,110
and the man began blabbering.

490
00:42:04,233 --> 00:42:10,740
He says it was part of a plan
to free the doctor, An Dao Quan.

491
00:42:10,740 --> 00:42:15,465
The one spearheading this operation
was a man named Chao Gai.

492
00:42:15,465 --> 00:42:17,295
Yet that is not all.

493
00:42:18,570 --> 00:42:20,060
Go on.

494
00:42:21,485 --> 00:42:25,800
This Chao Gai was dressed
as the Pagoda-Shifting Heavenly King.

495
00:42:25,800 --> 00:42:31,150
The two men are one and the same.

496
00:42:43,110 --> 00:42:46,560
Was he accompanied by a large, bald monk?

497
00:42:50,415 --> 00:42:52,370
I see.

498
00:42:52,370 --> 00:42:54,010
And his name?

499
00:42:56,690 --> 00:42:59,690
His name!

500
00:43:03,345 --> 00:43:04,960
What was that?

501
00:43:04,960 --> 00:43:06,881
Lu Zhi Shen.

502
00:43:06,881 --> 00:43:08,641
Lu Zhi Shen?

503
00:43:12,342 --> 00:43:16,700
The one who saved Gongsun Sheng
was the Pagoda-Shifting Heavenly King.

504
00:43:16,700 --> 00:43:23,530
Lin Chong has escaped to Liangshan Marsh.

505
00:43:23,530 --> 00:43:27,380
Are all these points connected?

506
00:43:27,380 --> 00:43:32,000
This is no laughing matter.

507
00:43:32,000 --> 00:43:34,290
How shall we combat this?

508
00:43:34,290 --> 00:43:36,230
I will make a report to Cai Jing.

509
00:43:36,230 --> 00:43:37,780
And what will you propose?

510
00:43:37,780 --> 00:43:41,960
That we deploy 4,000 of our soldiers
from Beijing.

511
00:43:41,960 --> 00:43:43,980
Li Fu.

512
00:43:43,980 --> 00:43:45,605
Yes, sir.

513
00:43:45,605 --> 00:43:47,365
I will capture Chao Gai at once.

514
00:43:47,365 --> 00:43:49,426
No.

515
00:43:49,426 --> 00:43:51,256
Kill him.

516
00:44:06,050 --> 00:44:11,430
Fire transforms into a plethora of shapes.

517
00:44:14,640 --> 00:44:19,620
No flame is the same
as any that come before it.

518
00:44:23,442 --> 00:44:28,289
My job is to simply stoke the flame...

519
00:44:29,040 --> 00:44:34,270
by feeding it the branches it needs to grow.

520
00:44:36,330 --> 00:44:38,210
Song Jiang and I both.

521
00:44:39,975 --> 00:44:43,230
Funnily enough, when I first met Song Jiang,

522
00:44:43,230 --> 00:44:47,630
I made a similar remark
about becoming a branch for him.

523
00:44:47,630 --> 00:44:52,935
When starting a fire,
one must first collect the branches.

524
00:44:52,935 --> 00:44:57,795
I shall become one of your many branches.

525
00:44:59,795 --> 00:45:01,920
I apologize for being late.

526
00:45:01,920 --> 00:45:05,610
What else have we learned from the fortress?

527
00:45:08,715 --> 00:45:13,700
Wang Lun is cautious,
and always accompanied by a guard.

528
00:45:13,700 --> 00:45:17,500
Though several wish to join our cause,

529
00:45:17,500 --> 00:45:21,580
they fear Wang Lun,
and cannot act out against him.

530
00:45:21,580 --> 00:45:25,070
To change the hearts of those ruled by fear,

531
00:45:25,070 --> 00:45:29,480
we need some other catalyst.

532
00:45:29,480 --> 00:45:31,690
I see.

533
00:45:31,690 --> 00:45:36,100
Then it will be impossible
to recruit Wang Lun after all...

534
00:45:36,100 --> 00:45:39,460
Where have we placed the stolen cargo?

535
00:45:39,460 --> 00:45:41,400
Right over there.

536
00:45:42,885 --> 00:45:45,750
Trouble!

537
00:45:45,750 --> 00:45:47,090
We have trouble, sir!

538
00:45:47,090 --> 00:45:48,870
What is it?

539
00:45:48,870 --> 00:45:52,025
4,000 soldiers
have been deployed from Beijing.

540
00:45:52,025 --> 00:45:53,705
They aim...

541
00:45:54,920 --> 00:45:56,950
For your neck, Chao Gai.

542
00:45:58,870 --> 00:46:00,600
What?

543
00:46:09,545 --> 00:46:12,240
[Chao Gai]

544
00:46:12,240 --> 00:46:14,250
- Do you know this man?
- No.

545
00:46:14,250 --> 00:46:15,905
Have you seen this man?

546
00:46:15,905 --> 00:46:18,205
Do you know this man?

547
00:46:19,460 --> 00:46:21,460
Have you seen this man?
[Yuncheng]

548
00:46:25,360 --> 00:46:27,580
Do you know this man?

549
00:46:29,250 --> 00:46:32,250
He is not an easy man to find.

550
00:46:33,435 --> 00:46:36,050
- Wang He.
- Yes, sir?

551
00:46:36,050 --> 00:46:38,350
Gather our spies.

552
00:46:38,350 --> 00:46:43,630
Search every place a bug like him
may scuttle under.

553
00:46:43,630 --> 00:46:47,030
The Chancellor has graced us with extra men.

554
00:46:47,875 --> 00:46:49,510
We may as well put them to use.

555
00:46:49,510 --> 00:46:50,870
Yes, sir.

556
00:46:55,230 --> 00:46:56,760
Wait.

557
00:46:59,236 --> 00:47:01,309
- I have him.
- Pardon?

558
00:47:02,246 --> 00:47:04,980
If I were Chao Gai,

559
00:47:07,540 --> 00:47:09,600
there is only one place to escape to.

560
00:47:11,385 --> 00:47:13,500
Chao Gai, that is a foolish move.

561
00:47:13,500 --> 00:47:17,250
I will simply bargain my way
into Liangshan Marsh.

562
00:47:17,250 --> 00:47:21,490
You will follow Lin Chong into those walls?

563
00:47:21,490 --> 00:47:24,310
This is a job only I can fulfill.

564
00:47:24,310 --> 00:47:26,750
- You will be killed.
- No.

565
00:47:26,750 --> 00:47:31,590
Chao Gai is a chivalrous bandit,
who stole from a chancellor.

566
00:47:31,590 --> 00:47:36,960
Wang Lun will not easily turn away
such a like-minded individual.

567
00:47:36,960 --> 00:47:41,670
He tried to assassinate Lin Chong.
He is clearly far gone.

568
00:47:41,670 --> 00:47:46,485
If he truly wished to conquer the heavens,
then he would keep his warriors.

569
00:47:46,485 --> 00:47:50,165
Yet he attempted to kill
one of his best soldiers.

570
00:47:50,165 --> 00:47:56,080
He is merely a man obsessed with power.

571
00:47:56,080 --> 00:47:58,680
You will be killed, Chao Gai!

572
00:47:59,665 --> 00:48:02,290
Though it is a gamble,

573
00:48:02,290 --> 00:48:06,640
it is one I am willing to take.

574
00:48:07,540 --> 00:48:11,850
I will head straight for that fortress.

575
00:48:13,755 --> 00:48:16,060
Song Jiang.

576
00:48:16,060 --> 00:48:18,540
I ask that you trust me.

577
00:48:21,080 --> 00:48:25,625
You must leave this place immediately.

578
00:48:25,625 --> 00:48:26,920
Why?

579
00:48:26,920 --> 00:48:31,750
The Beijing troops will stay
at your abode in Yuncheng.

580
00:48:31,750 --> 00:48:34,275
They cannot know you wrote

581
00:48:34,275 --> 00:48:37,635
"Enforcing the Way in Heaven's Name".

582
00:48:37,635 --> 00:48:41,100
Your name is not yet associated with us.

583
00:48:41,100 --> 00:48:44,700
This will prove useful to us in the future.

584
00:48:53,976 --> 00:49:00,120
Lin Chong led his life in isolation.

585
00:49:00,120 --> 00:49:04,735
Lu Zhi Shen spreads my word
to those across the nation.

586
00:49:04,735 --> 00:49:09,235
And now, you are heading into Death's maw.

587
00:49:11,125 --> 00:49:16,540
Yet I alone remain safe?

588
00:49:16,540 --> 00:49:19,230
Must I sit, and wait for my reports?

589
00:49:20,985 --> 00:49:23,520
I am left to my own wits,

590
00:49:23,520 --> 00:49:26,790
dreaming my dreams in solitude.

591
00:49:31,900 --> 00:49:37,000
That is your fight to fight.

592
00:49:44,370 --> 00:49:46,070
It is a battle...

593
00:49:47,496 --> 00:49:52,256
far more grueling than mine.

594
00:50:02,170 --> 00:50:04,730
- Load the ship.
- Yes, sir.

595
00:50:40,675 --> 00:50:42,810
The fortress at Liangshan Marsh?

596
00:50:42,810 --> 00:50:46,260
Will Wang Lun become ally to Chao Gai?

597
00:50:46,260 --> 00:50:52,100
A bandit who stole from a chancellor
is being chased by 4,000 soldiers.

598
00:50:52,100 --> 00:50:57,935
Though it is a gamble,
there is nowhere else he can run.

599
00:50:57,935 --> 00:51:00,110
Hurry, and ready our men.

600
00:51:00,110 --> 00:51:03,415
We must catch him before he makes his escape.

601
00:51:03,415 --> 00:51:04,845
Yes, sir.

602
00:51:18,560 --> 00:51:20,310
Chao Gai!

603
00:51:22,145 --> 00:51:23,812
Song Jiang.

604
00:51:23,812 --> 00:51:26,290
I told you, you mustn't come.

605
00:51:26,290 --> 00:51:30,050
I brought you liquor,
to keep you warm on the waters.

606
00:51:30,050 --> 00:51:32,420
Let us share a cup, as we part ways.

607
00:51:32,420 --> 00:51:35,475
I thought you chose not to drink.

608
00:51:35,475 --> 00:51:37,045
I will make an exception.

609
00:51:38,285 --> 00:51:41,030
- Shall I?
- Thank you.

610
00:51:41,030 --> 00:51:44,525
Let us depart while the Zhisi Squadron
distract the pursuing soldiers.

611
00:51:44,525 --> 00:51:46,605
We run short on time.

612
00:51:50,685 --> 00:51:52,837
Song Jiang.

613
00:51:52,837 --> 00:51:54,817
Think of yourself this way.

614
00:51:56,145 --> 00:51:59,240
You are the moon,
hidden by the afternoon sun.

615
00:51:59,240 --> 00:52:01,580
You bring no attention to yourself now.

616
00:52:01,580 --> 00:52:03,945
I understand the pain that must bring.

617
00:52:03,945 --> 00:52:10,005
But the moon will one day
illuminate these dark times.

618
00:52:11,760 --> 00:52:15,800
We all are comrades, united by one cause.

619
00:52:17,160 --> 00:52:23,230
We all know you are suffering most of all.

620
00:52:24,810 --> 00:52:26,430
Chao Gai...

621
00:52:27,915 --> 00:52:29,250
Your drinks.

622
00:52:29,250 --> 00:52:31,560
Thank you.

623
00:52:37,850 --> 00:52:41,810
To our future abode.

624
00:52:57,450 --> 00:53:00,790
I shall see you soon, my friend.

625
00:53:06,870 --> 00:53:09,020
Chao Gai.

626
00:53:12,260 --> 00:53:13,890
I have received your message.

627
00:53:15,130 --> 00:53:17,030
Loud and clear.

628
00:53:18,065 --> 00:53:22,230
Clear a path for our future!

629
00:53:22,230 --> 00:53:25,470
[Enforcing the Way in Heaven's Name]

630
00:53:40,390 --> 00:53:42,140
Lin Chong!

631
00:53:42,955 --> 00:53:44,530
The bells are sounding.

632
00:53:44,530 --> 00:53:48,325
Two boats are headed for our fortress.

633
00:53:48,325 --> 00:53:49,875
What?

634
00:53:54,095 --> 00:53:56,040
4,000 soldiers?

635
00:53:56,040 --> 00:54:00,330
Yes, sir. They are stationed
at the edges of the marsh.

636
00:54:00,330 --> 00:54:03,740
We believe they are with the Beijing army.

637
00:54:03,740 --> 00:54:08,201
There are also two unidentified boats
headed our way.

638
00:54:08,201 --> 00:54:10,461
What is going on?

639
00:54:13,135 --> 00:54:15,760
Increase the guard on our shores.

640
00:54:15,760 --> 00:54:17,200
Yes, sir.

641
00:54:20,380 --> 00:54:25,600
I believe the Pagoda-Shifting Heavenly King
rides that boat.

642
00:54:27,550 --> 00:54:29,960
He is my comrade.

643
00:54:29,960 --> 00:54:31,460
What?

644
00:55:46,096 --> 00:55:49,000
Was this not a fortress of the heart?

645
00:55:49,000 --> 00:55:51,410
You've exposed yourself, Lin Chong!

646
00:55:51,410 --> 00:55:53,630
The citizens' voices shall become our orders.

647
00:55:53,630 --> 00:55:55,577
Yang Zhi, the Blue-faced beast.

648
00:55:55,577 --> 00:55:57,655
I will make a country here.

649
00:55:57,655 --> 00:56:00,045
I will call this country, Mount Liang.

650
00:56:01,515 --> 00:56:05,110
A third-rate spy will always leave a trail.

651
00:56:05,110 --> 00:56:07,820
What about Wang Jin enamored you?

652
00:56:07,820 --> 00:56:09,290
Was it merely his strength?

653
00:56:09,290 --> 00:56:12,830
I made love to Deng Li Hua.

654
00:56:12,830 --> 00:56:15,630
They have established a perch for themselves.

655
00:56:15,630 --> 00:56:18,300
No, not yet.

656
00:56:18,300 --> 00:56:20,590
The author of "Enforcing the Way
in Heaven's Name" still remains at large.

657
00:56:20,590 --> 00:56:26,145
By raising the price of our salt,
we have cornered Chao Gai's foe.

658
00:56:26,145 --> 00:56:28,345
Qinglian Temple...

659
00:58:11,190 --> 00:58:15,850
[Episode 5 - FIN]

